== Trivia ==
* From version [[Java Edition 1.6.1|1.6.1]] through version [[Java Edition 1.19.4|1.19.4]], the application icon for {{JE}} was a crafting table. As of version [[Java Edition 1.20|1.20]], the icon for ''Java Edition'' is now a [[grass block]] (for releases), or a [[dirt]] block (for snapshots).
* The original [[inventory]] screen before January 29, 2010 was the crafting table interface. There were no [[armor]] slots, no [[off-hand]] slot, no [[recipe book]], nor viewport of the player's [[skin]].
* The texture of the crafting table visually features a hammer, saw, and pliers. None of these tools are currently implemented in the game.

=== Publicity ===

* In level 21 of [[I'm Not a Robot]], a crafting table's grid makes an appearance.
* As part of the [[Lego Icons]] line, a diorama set set inside of a crafting table was made. The set is notable for featuring several of the first minimobs in several years, specifically [[Steve]], a [[cow]], a [[skeleton]], a [[witch]], a [[creeper]], a [[villager]], a [[pig]], and [[Alex]].<ref>{{Citation|url=https://www.lego.com/en-us/product/the-crafting-table-21265|title=The Crafting Table|website=Lego.com}}</ref><ref>{{Citation|url=https://www.lego.com/en-us/categories/adults-welcome/lego-minecraft-crafting-table|title=How we crafted the LEGO® Minecraft® The Crafting Table set|website=Lego.com}}</ref>
* A crafting table appears as part of Steve's neutral special in ''[[Super Smash Bros. Ultimate]]''.

